<Page kicker="Legal" title="Cookie policy" path="/cookies/" description="Alm does not set cookies. Here is what that means and what our analytics does instead.">
  <p>Alm does not set any cookies, and it does not load advertising or social-media trackers. That is why there is no cookie banner.</p>
  <h2>Analytics without cookies</h2>
  <p>We count page views with Vercel Web Analytics, which does not use cookies or store anything on your device. See the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> for what it records.</p>
  <h2>Browser storage</h2>
  <p>The site does not use local storage, session storage or similar technologies.</p>
  <h2>Other websites</h2>
  <p>When you follow a link to another website, such as an official source or an operator in the Tourground directory, that site may set its own cookies under its own policy.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If we ever add cookies, we will update this page first and ask for consent where the law requires it.</p>
</Page>
